      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.acts.sahidica:23",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲙⲛⲛⲥⲱⲥ ⲕⲛⲁ**ϭⲛⲧⲥ** ⲉⲥⲥⲁϣⲉ ⲉⲩⲥⲓϣⲉ ⲁⲩⲱ ⲉⲥⲧⲏⲙ ⲉϩⲟⲩⲉⲟⲩⲥⲏϥⲉ ⲛϩⲟ ⲥⲛⲁⲩ",
      "english": "but afterwards thou wilt find her more bitter than gall, and sharper than a two-edged sword.",
